<div id="u-credit-00240-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dead-wood240" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6243991); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6243991&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606162751" alt="Dead wood240" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6243991)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dead-wood240" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6243991); return false;">Dead wood240</a></span></p>
